{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792313220, "covers_from": "2026-10-18T08:47:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-18T08:48:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792313280, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-18T08:47:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 29236, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "科技大樓捷運站附近的公車亭，座椅沒有避雨遮陽的效果，木頭都已經變黑變髒發霉了，希望能改善！", "display_name": "大安代表 吳景騰 BOIS", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T08:47:14+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 25688, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "每次看到外國人說台北的外觀都又老又舊, 覺得很心痛, 能否統一規劃把老公寓分區拉皮,規劃有特色的外觀", "display_name": "大安代表 Eva Li", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T08:47:29+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 17211, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "市政府規劃都不用腦，人行道中間一根電線桿、腳踏車道畫去撞牆等。Ubike很多但一般腳踏車都沒地方停", "display_name": "大安代表 No.17,211", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T08:47:44+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 11710, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "拜託台北不要再砍樹了，章萬安你到底想幹嘛", "display_name": "中山代表 No.11,710", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T08:47:50+00:00", "duration_seconds": 10, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 28875, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "環境", "content": "為什麼信義國中松仁路上的樹砍很多，原本美美的大樹都不見了", "display_name": "信義代表 珉淇 Mikki Chen", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 25688, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 Eva Li", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 17211, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.17,211", "district": "daan", "i